1
00:00:10,066 --> 00:00:11,299
Trust me, please.

2
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:13,300
Everything will be fine.

3
00:00:13,595 --> 00:00:14,776
If you want me to stay,

4
00:00:14,776 --> 00:00:16,123
I'm happy to stay.

5
00:00:16,516 --> 00:00:17,365
Don't go anywhere.

6
00:00:17,709 --> 00:00:18,744
Will you be my boyfriend?

7
00:00:18,744 --> 00:00:20,700
I will, I will be your boyfriend.

8
00:00:21,066 --> 00:00:25,200
I guess painless love does exist.

9
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:29,133
Tee, your phone.

10
00:00:29,766 --> 00:00:31,533
Can you check who it is?

11
00:00:35,892 --> 00:00:37,892
[Tee.]

12
00:00:38,187 --> 00:00:40,435
[Where are you?]

13
00:00:40,754 --> 00:00:42,754
[I really want to see you.]

14
00:00:42,823 --> 00:00:44,823
[I can't take it anymore.]

15
00:00:44,893 --> 00:00:46,893
[Can you come back to me?]

16
00:00:56,978 --> 00:01:00,255
Fuse, I'm done taking shower.

17
00:01:00,866 --> 00:01:01,666
Fuse.

18
00:01:04,566 --> 00:01:05,633
Where is he?

19
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:16,700
Where did he go?

20
00:01:32,466 --> 00:01:33,288
Baby.

21
00:01:33,926 --> 00:01:35,838
Daddy is coming to you.

22
00:03:12,366 --> 00:03:13,300
"I really want to see you."

23
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,700
"Can you come back to me?"

24
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:16,500
Ugh.

25
00:03:16,766 --> 00:03:18,666
Tee, are you sneaking around with someone else?

26
00:03:18,866 --> 00:03:20,366
Why do people keep going back to their ex?

27
00:03:20,633 --> 00:03:21,966
You said you liked me, didn't you?

28
00:03:25,633 --> 00:03:26,900
What's wrong, Fuse?

29
00:03:29,066 --> 00:03:32,233
Did my brother do something to upset you?

30
00:03:32,966 --> 00:03:33,833
Let me know.

31
00:03:35,566 --> 00:03:36,700
I'll deal with him.

32
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,166
Where are you going next?

33
00:03:46,166 --> 00:03:46,966
Going…

34
00:03:48,766 --> 00:03:49,700
Where to?

35
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:51,900
Oh.

36
00:03:52,966 --> 00:03:54,000
You came here this early.

37
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:56,700
Didn't you make a plan with him?

38
00:03:59,666 --> 00:04:00,466
Ah.

39
00:04:02,966 --> 00:04:03,766
Yes.

40
00:04:07,633 --> 00:04:09,366
How have you been?

41
00:04:10,900 --> 00:04:11,833
How is your class going?

42
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:14,700
Um.

43
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,800
Not bad.

44
00:04:18,866 --> 00:04:22,166
Tee came to ask me for advice the other day.

45
00:04:24,833 --> 00:04:27,400
He told me he failed one subject.

46
00:04:28,466 --> 00:04:30,300
How could someone like him fail the exam?

47
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,384
He also told me…

48
00:04:35,562 --> 00:04:38,394
it's the subject that he loves the most.

49
00:04:41,978 --> 00:04:46,366
Seems like he misunderstood everything.

50
00:04:49,766 --> 00:04:51,086
But I think…

51
00:04:53,295 --> 00:04:56,671
he's trying to retake an exam.

52
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:05,200
Do you think Tee will pass the exam this time?

53
00:05:08,966 --> 00:05:10,800
I think it depends on Tee.

54
00:05:12,566 --> 00:05:14,466
Whether he genuinely wants to pass this exam…

55
00:05:17,566 --> 00:05:21,100
or wants to take another exam instead.

56
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:39,200
When did you come down? You didn't tell me.

57
00:05:42,466 --> 00:05:43,566
Thank you for the meal.

58
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,374
Tim.

59
00:05:57,503 --> 00:05:58,833
What did you do to my person?

60
00:06:00,033 --> 00:06:01,633
You shouldn't be asking me.

61
00:06:02,566 --> 00:06:04,233
You should ask your own person.

62
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:06,900
Hey.

63
00:06:07,466 --> 00:06:08,766
What are you waiting for?

64
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,700
Go make it up to him.

65
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,600
Otherwise, you'll fail the exam again.

66
00:06:14,966 --> 00:06:15,919
No way.

67
00:06:16,655 --> 00:06:19,266
I must get A+ this time.

68
00:06:31,433 --> 00:06:34,018
Tee, you're pursuing me.

69
00:06:34,018 --> 00:06:35,966
How could you manage to talk to your ex?

70
00:06:46,873 --> 00:06:48,097
[Tee, where are you?]

71
00:06:48,097 --> 00:06:48,940
[I really want to see you.]

72
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:49,814
[I can't take it anymore.]

73
00:06:49,814 --> 00:06:51,180
[Can you come back to me?]

74
00:07:08,833 --> 00:07:09,633
Jeez.

75
00:07:22,833 --> 00:07:23,900
What are you guys doing?

76
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:26,600
I'm with my babe.
Let me hold it for you, babe. I gotta go.

77
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,800
Mo.

78
00:07:28,133 --> 00:07:29,833
I'm pooping. Let me hang up first.

79
00:07:29,833 --> 00:07:31,200
Frame.

80
00:07:31,636 --> 00:07:34,505
We're here for the makeup exam.
The teacher just called us, we've to go.

81
00:07:35,233 --> 00:07:36,033
Hey

82
00:07:37,866 --> 00:07:38,666
Hey.

83
00:07:40,866 --> 00:07:41,666
Ugh.

84
00:07:44,266 --> 00:07:45,266
No one is free to call me.

85
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:59,366
What's wrong? Why did you eat so little today?

86
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,140
Oh.

87
00:08:20,866 --> 00:08:22,142
Do you want something else to eat?

88
00:08:22,633 --> 00:08:23,796
Like me?

89
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:36,800
Won't you play along?

90
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:41,600
Why did you call your friends earlier?

91
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,800
You don't want to be with me anymore?

92
00:08:47,700 --> 00:08:48,500
I'm the one who should have said that.

93
00:08:51,033 --> 00:08:51,833
What?

94
00:08:57,233 --> 00:08:58,366
Have you replied her yet?

95
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:01,600
Reply to whom?

96
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:04,500
Or did you guys secretly
talk to each other without telling me?

97
00:09:05,266 --> 00:09:06,066
Huh?

98
00:09:07,166 --> 00:09:07,966
What do you mean?

99
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:11,272
Tee, look into my eyes.

100
00:09:12,598 --> 00:09:14,800
They say liars avoid eye contact.

101
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:21,600
Who told you that?

102
00:09:22,633 --> 00:09:23,466
Tee.

103
00:09:29,766 --> 00:09:31,066
I won't avoid your gaze.

104
00:09:32,033 --> 00:09:33,266
And I'll hold you in my arms as well.

105
00:09:37,433 --> 00:09:39,700
Why are you sulking? Talk to me.

106
00:09:42,566 --> 00:09:43,966
Your ex.

107
00:09:45,633 --> 00:09:46,433
My ex?

108
00:09:49,233 --> 00:09:50,266
Check your chat.

109
00:09:58,605 --> 00:10:01,538
[If you don't reply, I'll call you.]

110
00:10:16,100 --> 00:10:16,900
Hello?

111
00:10:18,500 --> 00:10:21,627
Where are you? Can you come over here?

112
00:10:21,833 --> 00:10:23,572
I want to see you.

113
00:10:24,266 --> 00:10:25,833
I'm busy right now.

114
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:31,400
Even you don't care about me?
Why is the world so mean to me?

115
00:10:32,263 --> 00:10:35,006
If you don't show up, I'll end my life.

116
00:10:35,326 --> 00:10:36,433
(Fuse) End her life? (Tee) End her life?

117
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:41,354
Hurry up, I'm waiting at our usual place.

118
00:10:50,366 --> 00:10:51,700
Why are you making that face?

119
00:10:53,166 --> 00:10:54,466
I brought you along with me.

120
00:10:55,166 --> 00:10:56,200
Are you still overthinking?

121
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:00,670
You still haven't told me…

122
00:11:00,670 --> 00:11:02,166
who Baikhao is.

123
00:11:04,666 --> 00:11:06,000
Baikhao is my ex.

124
00:11:06,233 --> 00:11:07,366
Well, I'm off.

125
00:11:07,833 --> 00:11:08,633
Hey.

126
00:11:10,866 --> 00:11:12,266
We broke up a long time ago.

127
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,400
We're really just friends right now.

128
00:11:15,866 --> 00:11:16,666
You sure?

129
00:11:17,766 --> 00:11:18,633
Absolutely.

130
00:11:19,433 --> 00:11:20,866
That's why I brought you along.

131
00:11:21,700 --> 00:11:23,300
So you don't have to overthink it on your own.

132
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,500
And you'll know that…

133
00:11:26,033 --> 00:11:27,366
You're the only one I love.

134
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:34,100
Fine, let's head over.

135
00:11:34,900 --> 00:11:36,433
I wonder if she's okay by now.

136
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:37,800
Come on.

137
00:11:41,143 --> 00:11:42,530
[Baikhao]

138
00:11:43,233 --> 00:11:44,033
Tee.

139
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:44,966
I really miss you.

140
00:11:47,666 --> 00:11:48,566
This one is good.

141
00:11:48,966 --> 00:11:49,833
You should try some.

142
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:52,900
Hey.

143
00:12:05,833 --> 00:12:06,677
This is Fuse.

144
00:12:07,315 --> 00:12:07,993
My friend.

145
00:12:09,417 --> 00:12:10,257
This is Baikhao.

146
00:12:13,203 --> 00:12:13,846
Hi.

147
00:12:16,033 --> 00:12:17,600
Is he your new friend?

148
00:12:18,266 --> 00:12:19,400
I've never seen him before.

149
00:12:20,666 --> 00:12:22,433
He seems a bit rude.

150
00:12:23,833 --> 00:12:27,000
I normally see you hanging around with Champ and Copter.

151
00:12:28,233 --> 00:12:30,833
I've been closest to him lately.

152
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,200
Oh, really?

153
00:12:34,566 --> 00:12:35,800
How envious.

154
00:12:40,400 --> 00:12:42,243
How are you doing?

155
00:12:43,029 --> 00:12:44,066
About what you tell me.

156
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:47,233
About I'm going to end my life?

157
00:12:48,666 --> 00:12:49,466
Huh.

158
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,000
I'm not going to die easily.

159
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,500
As long as she's still breathing,

160
00:12:52,833 --> 00:12:54,066
I refuse to die.

161
00:12:55,633 --> 00:12:56,500
Who are you talking about?

162
00:12:56,900 --> 00:12:59,100
The person who Babe liked her post.

163
00:12:59,666 --> 00:13:01,066
It's driving me crazy.

164
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:03,666
There are millions of profiles on IG,

165
00:13:03,966 --> 00:13:05,400
And yet he chose to like her post.

166
00:13:05,833 --> 00:13:07,233
I already told Babe that…

167
00:13:07,366 --> 00:13:08,566
If this happens one more time,

168
00:13:08,700 --> 00:13:09,475
we're done.

169
00:13:09,868 --> 00:13:10,859
Mark my words.

170
00:13:13,800 --> 00:13:15,700
I'm done for real this time.

171
00:13:16,366 --> 00:13:18,339
Am I not good enough?

172
00:13:18,339 --> 00:13:20,466
Why did he have to like her post?

173
00:13:20,866 --> 00:13:21,628
Baikhao, chill out.

174
00:13:21,628 --> 00:13:22,721
Have you talked to you boyfriend?

175
00:13:23,212 --> 00:13:24,466
He might have misclicked.

176
00:13:26,066 --> 00:13:27,164
No, I won't talk to him.

177
00:13:27,164 --> 00:13:29,814
I already blocked him and I'll throw my phone away.

178
00:13:29,814 --> 00:13:30,832
Wait, wait.

179
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,300
Chill out.

180
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:34,100
Take it easy.

181
00:13:39,166 --> 00:13:40,900
Did someone say my name?

182
00:13:48,765 --> 00:13:49,743
Babe.

183
00:13:51,433 --> 00:13:52,940
I'm sorry.

184
00:13:54,400 --> 00:13:55,566
You've got it wrong.

185
00:13:56,366 --> 00:13:57,433
Hear me out, please.

186
00:13:57,833 --> 00:14:00,000
Why didn't you tell me in the first place?

187
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,500
You blocked me.

188
00:14:03,966 --> 00:14:05,900
Let's head back. I want to go home.

189
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,366
Okay.

190
00:14:21,033 --> 00:14:22,500
What just happened?

191
00:14:23,566 --> 00:14:25,100
Well, it's Baikhao and her boyfriend.

192
00:14:26,366 --> 00:14:27,466
I already knew that.

193
00:14:27,866 --> 00:14:29,200
Are you messing with me?

194
00:14:29,566 --> 00:14:31,100
She is usually like this.

195
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,066
Always arguing with her boyfriend.

196
00:14:32,666 --> 00:14:34,266
But they actually love each other.

197
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,394
She's fighting with her boyfriend,

198
00:14:36,394 --> 00:14:37,966
and yet she calls you?

199
00:14:38,866 --> 00:14:39,678
Why?

200
00:14:40,365 --> 00:14:41,100
Are you jealous?

201
00:14:42,866 --> 00:14:43,666
No.

202
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,966
I'm just asking.

203
00:14:47,833 --> 00:14:51,266
So that means I can meet her again in the future?

204
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:52,833
Tee.

205
00:14:54,433 --> 00:14:55,233
I'm kidding.

206
00:14:56,766 --> 00:14:58,633
Baikhao and I are just friends.

207
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,600
Can you really be friends with an ex?

208
00:15:03,033 --> 00:15:04,433
I can be friends with everyone…

209
00:15:05,966 --> 00:15:06,833
except one person.

210
00:15:08,266 --> 00:15:09,066
Who?

211
00:15:09,866 --> 00:15:10,666
It's you.

212
00:15:11,266 --> 00:15:12,666
Are you gonna cutting me off?

213
00:15:13,033 --> 00:15:14,073
Are you stupid?

214
00:15:14,073 --> 00:15:14,666
Huh?

215
00:15:15,033 --> 00:15:15,833
What did you say?

216
00:15:16,666 --> 00:15:17,666
Nothing.

217
00:15:18,700 --> 00:15:20,633
If it bothers you, I can block her.

218
00:15:20,966 --> 00:15:22,018
It's okay.

219
00:15:22,656 --> 00:15:23,358
Tee, you don't have to.

220
00:15:24,438 --> 00:15:25,466
She's your friend.

221
00:15:26,448 --> 00:15:27,591
I'm also your friend.

222
00:15:28,426 --> 00:15:29,455
It's not my place to to stop you.

223
00:15:34,866 --> 00:15:35,666
You can.

224
00:15:39,833 --> 00:15:41,033
Who am I to to stop you?

225
00:15:59,966 --> 00:16:00,895
Hey, Fuse.

226
00:16:00,895 --> 00:16:02,239
Let's go on a trip.

227
00:16:02,239 --> 00:16:04,712
Wit's resort will cover everything.

228
00:16:04,712 --> 00:16:06,337
Free food and accommodation.

229
00:16:06,337 --> 00:16:08,299
Super chill.

230
00:16:08,544 --> 00:16:10,083
Hey, it's not like that.

231
00:16:10,476 --> 00:16:13,200
Cool, I'm in.

232
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,500
Great, see you at school tomorrow.

233
00:16:15,766 --> 00:16:17,633
Whoa, let's go.

234
00:16:19,466 --> 00:16:20,266
Tomorrow?

235
00:16:21,066 --> 00:16:21,866
Hello?

236
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:22,900
Hello? Hello?

237
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:24,233
Leaving tomorrow?

238
00:16:27,033 --> 00:16:28,566
Will you go on a trip with me?

239
00:16:30,600 --> 00:16:31,400
Sure.

240
00:16:36,902 --> 00:16:37,454
Um.

241
00:16:39,662 --> 00:16:40,757
On this trip,

242
00:16:42,178 --> 00:16:42,964
I think…

243
00:16:43,873 --> 00:16:45,304
I'll ask Tee to be my boyfriend.

244
00:16:46,771 --> 00:16:47,271
Go for it.

245
00:16:47,530 --> 00:16:48,289
I'll help you.

246
00:17:02,511 --> 00:17:06,504
Let's go.

247
00:17:06,973 --> 00:17:08,973
Let's go on a trip.

248
00:17:15,744 --> 00:17:16,544
Hey.

249
00:17:16,611 --> 00:17:17,411
Hotties.

250
00:17:17,911 --> 00:17:19,411
Yeah, fox-like top.

251
00:17:20,011 --> 00:17:20,811
Hey.

252
00:17:22,511 --> 00:17:23,311
Puupy boy.

253
00:17:23,611 --> 00:17:24,411
Woof-woof.

254
00:17:24,977 --> 00:17:26,311
Tanned country boy.

255
00:17:26,911 --> 00:17:27,711
Thanks.

256
00:17:28,811 --> 00:17:29,611
Ouch.

257
00:17:31,744 --> 00:17:32,877
Nerd, come here.

258
00:17:39,877 --> 00:17:41,270
Good things are meant to be shared,

259
00:17:41,270 --> 00:17:43,777
but don't linger. The owner is jealous.

260
00:17:45,544 --> 00:17:48,011
The owner is so scary.

261
00:17:54,711 --> 00:17:57,277
Is that Tee, your crush?

262
00:17:58,411 --> 00:18:00,780
Yep. He already look handsome in the uniform,…

263
00:18:00,780 --> 00:18:01,711
but he look even more handsome in casual clothes.

264
00:18:02,211 --> 00:18:03,611
I heard that he's single.

265
00:18:04,011 --> 00:18:04,811
Go for him.

266
00:18:05,111 --> 00:18:06,177
No way.

267
00:18:15,111 --> 00:18:15,611
Hmm?

268
00:18:15,611 --> 00:18:16,944
Do you like it when people stare at you?

269
00:18:17,011 --> 00:18:18,944
Oh, no no no.

270
00:18:19,611 --> 00:18:20,611
What's up, bro?

271
00:18:20,944 --> 00:18:21,777
Yay, bro.

272
00:18:22,677 --> 00:18:25,477
Wit's driver is here, let's go.

273
00:18:26,344 --> 00:18:27,177
Let's go.

274
00:18:29,144 --> 00:18:30,111
Come on.

275
00:18:30,811 --> 00:18:31,611
Let's go.

276
00:18:32,344 --> 00:18:33,611
Tee, you go ahead.

277
00:18:34,211 --> 00:18:35,177
I need to pee.

278
00:18:35,577 --> 00:18:37,277
Give me your bag. I'll carry it.

279
00:18:38,377 --> 00:18:39,177
Thanks.

280
00:18:42,877 --> 00:18:43,711
Hurry up.

281
00:18:44,211 --> 00:18:45,011
Mo.

282
00:18:49,544 --> 00:18:50,344
What?

283
00:18:53,011 --> 00:18:54,511
Can I ask your advice on something?

284
00:18:55,911 --> 00:18:56,711
Go ahead.

285
00:19:00,811 --> 00:19:02,711
I've been thinking…

286
00:19:05,177 --> 00:19:05,977
I think…

287
00:19:09,777 --> 00:19:10,577
