00:34:33,898 --> 00:34:34,865
she saw…

584
00:34:40,265 --> 00:34:41,059
a dust.

585
00:34:41,059 --> 00:34:41,559
Gosh!

586
00:34:42,898 --> 00:34:43,698
Ugh.

587
00:34:44,132 --> 00:34:45,198
Wit.

588
00:34:45,698 --> 00:34:46,498
Alright.

589
00:34:48,932 --> 00:34:50,632
The body of that woman…

590
00:34:54,598 --> 00:34:56,386
was drenched in blood.

591
00:34:56,386 --> 00:34:57,198
Oh.

592
00:34:58,932 --> 00:34:59,998
After that incident,

593
00:35:01,498 --> 00:35:02,732
some guests who stayed here…

594
00:35:06,498 --> 00:35:07,646
said that…

595
00:35:10,101 --> 00:35:11,407
they heard a women laughing…

596
00:35:12,880 --> 00:35:14,147
and crying.

597
00:35:17,731 --> 00:35:18,865
But some of them…

598
00:35:22,432 --> 00:35:23,665
saw the woman sitting on the bench.

599
00:35:30,432 --> 00:35:34,832
My dad had to invite a monk for chanting,

600
00:35:37,032 --> 00:35:38,498
but it didn't hep at all.

601
00:35:39,798 --> 00:35:42,760
So he decided to leave that bench…

602
00:35:43,545 --> 00:35:44,483
in a storage.

603
00:35:49,298 --> 00:35:51,332
And nobody dared to touch it ever again.

604
00:35:57,265 --> 00:35:58,432
That's the story.

605
00:36:10,732 --> 00:36:12,932
Let's do a test.

606
00:36:13,732 --> 00:36:14,532
A test?

607
00:36:15,065 --> 00:36:16,298
A test of courage.

608
00:36:17,032 --> 00:36:19,598
Whoever brave enough to take a selfie with the bench,

609
00:36:19,998 --> 00:36:21,732
I'll carry your bag all day tomorrow.

610
00:36:22,665 --> 00:36:23,532
Ugh.

611
00:36:24,498 --> 00:36:25,298
Save it.

612
00:36:25,465 --> 00:36:27,032
I can carry my wife's bag.

613
00:36:27,698 --> 00:36:28,498
Frame.

614
00:36:29,232 --> 00:36:30,732
I told you not to call me as a wife.

615
00:36:34,298 --> 00:36:36,694
I'm out. It looks so dusty.

616
00:36:36,694 --> 00:36:37,798
My skin will break out.

617
00:36:38,198 --> 00:36:40,065
I'm out. It's nonsense.

618
00:36:40,332 --> 00:36:41,598
I agree with you.

619
00:36:42,098 --> 00:36:42,898
Or…

620
00:36:43,832 --> 00:36:45,332
are you guys still scared of ghosts?

621
00:36:45,698 --> 00:36:46,865
You're in the 11th grade now.

622
00:36:47,398 --> 00:36:48,298
I'll do it.

623
00:36:49,298 --> 00:36:50,132
Who are you going with?

624
00:36:51,098 --> 00:36:52,265
With Tee, obviously.

625
00:36:53,698 --> 00:36:54,632
Hey, Fuse.

626
00:36:55,598 --> 00:36:58,065
Are you gonna let a 10th grade kid look down on us like this?

627
00:36:58,932 --> 00:37:00,698
We need to prove to this kid…

628
00:37:01,065 --> 00:37:02,465
that ghosts aren't exist.

629
00:37:03,632 --> 00:37:04,798
Only taking a photo, right?

630
00:37:07,698 --> 00:37:08,698
Let's go, Tee.

631
00:37:11,665 --> 00:37:12,465
You got this.

632
00:37:14,598 --> 00:37:15,698
Come on, you can do it.

633
00:37:33,032 --> 00:37:33,865
Are you scared?

634
00:37:34,598 --> 00:37:35,398
Shall we go back?

635
00:37:36,432 --> 00:37:38,098
If you're scared, why did you come?

636
00:37:39,532 --> 00:37:40,332
I won't go back.

637
00:37:41,698 --> 00:37:43,198
Rodtang will laugh at us.

638
00:37:44,865 --> 00:37:45,665
Are you scared?

639
00:37:48,632 --> 00:37:49,932
I'm more scared of people.

640
00:37:51,032 --> 00:37:53,098
What if there is a robber in here?

641
00:37:54,465 --> 00:37:55,432
Give it to me.

642
00:37:57,398 --> 00:37:58,498
Stand behind me then.

643
00:38:05,932 --> 00:38:08,865
Hold on, I think just a front shot is enough.

644
00:38:10,298 --> 00:38:12,798
No way, they're gonna think we're chickens.

645
00:38:14,698 --> 00:38:18,065
Let's make it quick and head back.

646
00:38:36,265 --> 00:38:36,765
Gosh!

647
00:38:36,765 --> 00:38:37,398
Oh!

648
00:38:37,665 --> 00:38:38,598
What's that?

649
00:38:38,832 --> 00:38:40,098
What's going on?

650
00:38:40,098 --> 00:38:40,898
What's that?

651
00:38:41,132 --> 00:38:41,932
What's going on?

652
00:38:42,032 --> 00:38:42,732
What happened?

653
00:38:42,732 --> 00:38:44,232
Tee, what's that?

654
00:38:45,265 --> 00:38:46,071
A bowl.

655
00:38:48,673 --> 00:38:49,854
It scared me.

656
00:38:50,983 --> 00:38:52,133
Oh!

657
00:38:55,373 --> 00:38:58,632
A Buddha statue. We apologize.

658
00:39:04,298 --> 00:39:05,787
Tee.

659
00:39:07,407 --> 00:39:08,429
Is this the bench?

660
00:39:10,295 --> 00:39:12,037
The one that had a body under it?

661
00:39:12,037 --> 00:39:12,865
Hey.

662
00:39:13,749 --> 00:39:15,160
Don't say like that.

663
00:39:17,124 --> 00:39:19,482
Alright, let's take a photo and head back.

664
00:39:31,532 --> 00:39:32,798
Won't you check the photos?

665
00:39:33,265 --> 00:39:35,132
No way, I'm afraid I will spot something else.

666
00:39:35,865 --> 00:39:37,229
If you're this scared,

667
00:39:38,064 --> 00:39:39,578
you don't have to do it in the first place.

668
00:39:40,118 --> 00:39:42,465
Because I'll carry your bag anyway tomorrow.

669
00:39:46,198 --> 00:39:47,832
Alright, let's head back.

670
00:39:53,265 --> 00:39:54,065
You're not heading back?

671
00:39:59,065 --> 00:40:00,198
I came here…

672
00:40:04,065 --> 00:40:05,665
just because I wanted to be with you alone.

673
00:40:09,465 --> 00:40:12,106
Do you remember that…

674
00:40:12,106 --> 00:40:14,132
we're in the same class in middle school?

675
00:40:17,398 --> 00:40:18,579
But we weren't close back then.

676
00:40:18,579 --> 00:40:19,432
Fuse.

677
00:40:20,265 --> 00:40:21,065
What are you doing?

678
00:40:21,132 --> 00:40:23,098
I'm solving the math homework that is due today.

679
00:40:23,665 --> 00:40:25,198
But in high school,

680
00:40:26,832 --> 00:40:28,332
we became close out of nowhere.

681
00:40:38,432 --> 00:40:40,465
I'm so glad we got close.

682
00:40:45,465 --> 00:40:48,117
You're always be by my side whenever I'm in trouble.

683
00:40:50,081 --> 00:40:51,512
Even though I make you cry,

684
00:40:52,543 --> 00:40:53,699
you never walk away.

685
00:40:55,663 --> 00:40:57,348
Thank you.

686
00:40:58,281 --> 00:41:01,497
And I'm sorry for making you sad.

687
00:41:10,032 --> 00:41:13,003
But I won't let it happen again.

688
00:41:13,936 --> 00:41:17,191
I'll care you the way you care me.

689
00:41:18,298 --> 00:41:21,232
I'll understand you the way you understand me.

690
00:41:22,698 --> 00:41:25,665
I'll take care of you the way you take care of me.

691
00:41:27,865 --> 00:41:30,698
I will never hurt you.

692
00:41:36,332 --> 00:41:38,332
Because I don't want to lose you again.

693
00:41:42,732 --> 00:41:43,568
Tee.

694
00:41:45,238 --> 00:41:47,409
Do you think…

695
00:41:47,409 --> 00:41:49,642
we'll be together forever from now on?

696
00:41:53,998 --> 00:41:55,265
Not as a friend.

697
00:42:00,332 --> 00:42:01,232
But as a…

698
00:42:05,432 --> 00:42:06,232
What?

699
00:42:06,632 --> 00:42:07,432
Oh.

700
00:42:07,998 --> 00:42:08,798
Oh!

701
00:42:11,665 --> 00:42:12,465
Tee.

702
00:42:13,098 --> 00:42:13,898
What's this?

703
00:42:17,732 --> 00:42:18,532
Fuse.

704
00:42:23,432 --> 00:42:25,432
A lot has happened recently.

705
00:42:28,265 --> 00:42:29,532
It made me sad sometimes.

706
00:42:30,732 --> 00:42:33,265
Fuse, I bought a cake for you.

707
00:42:36,698 --> 00:42:38,298
And every good thing in your life,

708
00:42:39,032 --> 00:42:40,132
you'd better keep it for yourself.

709
00:42:40,865 --> 00:42:42,432
Can we go back to be friends?

710
00:42:45,198 --> 00:42:46,265
Believe it or not,

711
00:42:48,098 --> 00:42:49,632
I've never stopped loving you.

712
00:42:55,898 --> 00:42:57,101
I'm so grateful for everything that…

713
00:42:58,868 --> 00:43:01,041
brought me to a cutie like you.

714
00:43:02,023 --> 00:43:02,997
You know what,

715
00:43:04,421 --> 00:43:05,832
I like you from the first day.

716
00:43:08,065 --> 00:43:09,498
When we got close,

717
00:43:10,098 --> 00:43:11,298
I'm so happy.

718
00:43:12,665 --> 00:43:15,065
You've meant more and more to me as time goes by.

719
00:43:17,032 --> 00:43:18,598
You don't need to apologize at all.

720
00:43:20,832 --> 00:43:22,440
I did it because I wanted to.

721
00:43:23,962 --> 00:43:24,982
I'm not going anywhere…

722
00:43:26,062 --> 00:43:27,232
because I love you.

723
00:43:29,832 --> 00:43:30,664
From now on,

724
00:43:32,186 --> 00:43:33,413
no matter what happens,

725
00:43:35,033 --> 00:43:36,341
I'll never give up.

726
00:43:38,010 --> 00:43:39,477
About what you asked…

727
00:43:41,498 --> 00:43:43,432
if we'll stay together forever,

728
00:43:45,498 --> 00:43:46,832
I think I can do it.

729
00:43:50,932 --> 00:43:53,598
What about you? Can you do it?

730
00:44:00,598 --> 00:44:01,932
I mean not as a friend.

731
00:44:11,265 --> 00:44:12,598
Will you be my boyfriend?

732
00:44:16,198 --> 00:44:16,998
I will, definitely.

733
00:45:28,298 --> 00:45:29,982
Surprise!

734
00:45:30,898 --> 00:45:32,065
You scared me.

735
00:45:32,398 --> 00:45:33,698
I'm happy for you, Fuse.

736
00:45:33,998 --> 00:45:36,124
Congrats.

737
00:45:37,065 --> 00:45:37,865
Tee.

738
00:45:38,198 --> 00:45:39,632
Take care of my friend.

739
00:45:40,232 --> 00:45:41,363
I'll not only take care of him.

740
00:45:41,363 --> 00:45:42,232
Huh?

741
00:45:42,832 --> 00:45:43,632
I'll have him for keeps as well.

742
00:45:44,065 --> 00:45:46,076
Ugh.

743
00:45:46,507 --> 00:45:48,798
How long are you gonna keep farming aura?

744
00:45:50,132 --> 00:45:50,932
You're farming aura too hard.

745
00:45:51,065 --> 00:45:51,565
Wit.

746
00:45:51,565 --> 00:45:52,065
Huh?

747
00:45:52,198 --> 00:45:53,598
So, is the ghost story real?

748
00:45:54,065 --> 00:45:54,798
Ah.

749
00:45:54,798 --> 00:45:55,694
The ghost story.

750
00:45:55,694 --> 00:45:56,194
Um.

751
00:45:56,832 --> 00:45:58,798
It's not real. I made it up.

752
00:45:58,932 --> 00:46:00,305
Oh.

753
00:46:00,532 --> 00:46:02,032
Hey, is it scary?

754
00:46:02,498 --> 00:46:05,232
If so, I'll share it on The Ghost Radio.

755
00:46:07,073 --> 00:46:09,073
Alright, let's take a selfie to wrap up the day.

756
00:46:09,073 --> 00:46:10,041
Com here.

757
00:46:10,041 --> 00:46:11,206
Great.

758
00:46:32,312 --> 00:46:35,044
I wonder, in the next ten years,

759
00:46:35,855 --> 00:46:37,439
what you all will be doing?

760
00:46:37,659 --> 00:46:38,313
Stop it.

761
00:46:39,352 --> 00:46:40,492
We might fall.

762
00:46:42,144 --> 00:46:43,711
We'd better go to school or we'll be late.

763
00:46:44,559 --> 00:46:45,393
Just keep walking forward,

764
00:46:45,995 --> 00:46:46,912
towards my future…

765
00:46:48,049 --> 00:46:49,483
and my love.

766
00:47:03,267 --> 00:47:05,133
Do you think I'm dreaming?

767
00:47:05,900 --> 00:47:06,700
Dreaming?

768
00:47:08,133 --> 00:47:09,900
I'm dreaming that we're a couple.

769
00:47:11,733 --> 00:47:13,300
And it's our anniversary now.

770
00:47:15,033 --> 00:47:15,867
Our anniversary?

771
00:47:18,467 --> 00:47:20,833
Our one-hour anniversary.

772
00:47:21,533 --> 00:47:22,967
Are you gonna count it in hours?

773
00:47:23,633 --> 00:47:24,927
I'll count every minute.

774
00:47:25,172 --> 00:47:26,380
Every hour.

775
00:47:26,577 --> 00:47:27,710
Every day.

776
00:47:28,054 --> 00:47:29,034
Every month.

777
00:47:29,034 --> 00:47:31,333
And every year that we've been together.

778
00:47:32,533 --> 00:47:33,333
Wow.

779
00:47:35,233 --> 00:47:36,133
What if…

780
00:47:37,567 --> 00:47:40,733
we broke up, would you still be friends with me?

781
00:47:46,833 --> 00:47:48,065
You told me.

782
00:47:48,065 --> 00:47:50,136
If we want good things to happen with us,

783
00:47:50,381 --> 00:47:51,829
we must speak only good words.

784
00:47:52,173 --> 00:47:55,169
So speak only good words, okay?

785
00:47:58,033 --> 00:47:59,267
Can I kiss you?

786
00:48:02,067 --> 00:48:04,867
We're a couple now. You can do whatever you want.

787
00:48:07,900 --> 00:48:09,233
Close your eyes then.

788
00:49:49,768 --> 00:49:52,338
[Darling]

789
00:50:06,567 --> 00:50:07,367
Hello?

790
00:50:09,231 --> 00:50:10,567
Are you up yet, darling?

791
00:50:11,967 --> 00:50:14,233
When did you change your name in my phone?

792
00:50:15,733 --> 00:50:17,233
You're already my boyfriend.

793
00:50:17,667 --> 00:50:20,167
So I have to give you a proper nickname. Have you left yet?

794
00:50:20,625 --> 00:50:22,360
I'm almost at school.

795
00:50:22,967 --> 00:50:25,100
What? Why are you rushing to school?

796
00:50:26,467 --> 00:50:28,367
I'm rushing to see my boyfriend.

797
00:50:28,725 --> 00:50:29,825
You should hurry up and get here.

798
00:50:30,285 --> 00:50:31,727
I'm waiting to go to class with you.

799
00:50:33,700 --> 00:50:36,233
Alright, I'll be there soon.

800
00:50:48,467 --> 00:50:49,733
Slow down, Fuse.

801
00:50:50,133 --> 00:50:53,367
If you fall and hit your head,
I won't have time to take you to the hospital.

802
00:50:53,767 --> 00:50:54,567
Um.

803
00:50:54,733 --> 00:50:56,167
I'm just a little brother,

804
00:50:56,933 --> 00:50:58,633
not like that person.

805
00:51:01,267 --> 00:51:02,067
Ping.

806
00:51:02,700 --> 00:51:03,533
What are we then?

807
00:51:08,133 --> 00:51:08,933
Yeah.

808
00:51:09,067 --> 00:51:09,967
You're just a little brother.

809
00:51:10,567 --> 00:51:12,267
How could you ever compete with my girlfriend?

810
00:51:13,233 --> 00:51:14,100
What did you say again?

811
00:51:14,467 --> 00:51:15,567
Are we a couple?

812
00:51:16,733 --> 00:51:17,533
Am I right?

813
00:51:18,467 --> 00:51:19,333
Are we a couple now?

814
00:51:21,133 --> 00:51:22,633
Now that you know, get going.

815
00:51:23,067 --> 00:51:23,867
Fine.

816
00:51:27,167 --> 00:51:28,033
Right, Jie.

817
00:51:28,900 --> 00:51:30,100
I have something to tell you.

818
00:51:31,733 --> 00:51:33,100
I also have my boyfriend.

819
00:51:33,867 --> 00:51:35,733
I knew it for a while.

820
00:51:36,667 --> 00:51:37,467
Huh?

821
00:51:38,133 --> 00:51:41,700
You're still young, make sure you don't go too far.

822
00:51:42,500 --> 00:51:43,640
You know what,

823
00:51:43,640 --> 00:51:44,948
I already did it.

824
00:51:44,948 --> 00:51:46,033
Fuse.

825
00:51:46,900 --> 00:51:47,700
I'm kidding.

826
00:51:51,467 --> 00:51:52,267
You can go now.

827
00:51:52,433 --> 00:51:53,333
Alright, I'm leaving.

828
00:51:54,300 --> 00:51:55,767
So, we're a couple now.

829
00:51:57,067 --> 00:51:57,867
Right?

830
00:51:58,700 --> 00:51:59,500
Hmm?

831
00:52:00,233 --> 00:52:01,033
Hmm?

832
00:52:02,867 --> 00:52:03,667
Um.

833
00:52:04,300 --> 00:52:05,100
Really?

834
00:52:10,232 --> 00:52:12,539
You always got it messy from your youth until your old age.

835
00:52:14,413 --> 00:52:17,433
You always wipe it for me until we're old too.

836
00:52:19,988 --> 00:52:21,988
Um, here.

837
00:52:26,267 --> 00:52:27,067
Fuse.

838
00:52:27,700 --> 00:52:28,500
Pa. Ma.

839
00:52:30,700 --> 00:52:32,167
I have to go to school now.

840
00:52:33,255 --> 00:52:34,322
Come here.

841
00:52:39,433 --> 00:52:41,194
Hey, not completed yet.

842
00:52:41,194 --> 00:52:41,853
Before leaving.

843
00:52:41,853 --> 00:52:42,675
Ah.

844
00:52:46,125 --> 00:52:50,968
So heartwarming. Look, someone is sulking.

845
00:52:50,968 --> 00:52:53,553
Give your mom a kiss as well.

846
00:52:53,553 --> 00:52:54,915
There, there.

847
00:52:56,933 --> 00:52:58,967
Come on, just one quick kiss.

848
00:53:03,300 --> 00:53:04,100
Alright.

849
00:53:05,900 --> 00:53:06,700
See you later.

850
00:53:07,367 --> 00:53:08,733
Take care, sweetheart.

851
00:53:15,867 --> 00:53:16,667
Please have a seat.

852
00:53:21,300 --> 00:53:22,100
Wait a sec.

853
00:53:25,833 --> 00:53:27,267
Rice soup is here.

854
00:53:42,533 --> 00:53:43,767
Did you make it yourself?

855
00:53:44,167 --> 00:53:45,933
Nah, my mom made it.

856
00:53:46,300 --> 00:53:47,567
Jeez, Frame.

857
00:53:48,167 --> 00:53:50,283
But my mom's cooking is good,

858
00:53:50,528 --> 00:53:51,767
so I brought some extra for you.

859
00:53:52,500 --> 00:53:53,300
Okay.

860
00:53:53,833 --> 00:53:55,139
Let's eat at my place next time.

861
00:53:55,139 --> 00:53:56,167
Um.

862
00:54:08,167 --> 00:54:08,967
Is it tasty?

863
00:54:11,467 --> 00:54:14,533
It is, but not as tasty as you.

864
00:54:15,833 --> 00:54:16,633
Such a sweet talker.

865
00:54:35,367 --> 00:54:36,167
Hey.

866
00:54:36,300 --> 00:54:37,567
Which number is this?

867
00:54:39,133 --> 00:54:40,033
It's exactly the thousandth one.

868
00:54:40,333 --> 00:54:41,133
Really?

869
00:54:42,100 --> 00:54:43,567
Does this mean you get to make a wish now?

870
00:54:44,667 --> 00:54:45,467
Yeah.

871
00:54:46,767 --> 00:54:47,733
Not me, but you.

872
00:54:48,067 --> 00:54:49,433
What? Why?

873
00:54:51,067 --> 00:54:51,567
Well…

874
00:54:52,500 --> 00:54:53,975
The person who can make a wish…

875
00:54:54,662 --> 00:54:56,467
is the one to fold the thousandth one.

876
00:54:57,100 --> 00:54:58,248
Huh? You mean me?

877
00:54:58,984 --> 00:55:00,207
I stole it from you.

878
00:55:00,993 --> 00:55:03,519
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to steal it.

879
00:55:03,912 --> 00:55:04,767
I'm sorry.

880
00:55:06,267 --> 00:55:07,067
It's okay.

881
00:55:07,733 --> 00:55:08,733
You should make a wish.

882
00:55:12,067 --> 00:55:12,867
Well,

883
00:55:16,867 --> 00:55:17,745
I wish…

884
00:55:18,923 --> 00:55:20,602
my boyfriend could make a wish.

885
00:55:20,946 --> 00:55:23,697
See? Isn't it cool?

886
00:55:23,942 --> 00:55:26,516
So you can make a wish now.

887
00:55:30,633 --> 00:55:31,467
Um.

888
00:55:32,900 --> 00:55:33,695
Well,

889
00:55:35,119 --> 00:55:39,067
I wish my boyfriend a lot of happiness.

890
00:55:39,367 --> 00:55:41,133
Hey, why that wish?

891
00:55:42,667 --> 00:55:43,467
Because…

892
00:55:44,833 --> 00:55:46,133
if you're happy,

893
00:55:47,367 --> 00:55:48,300
I'm happy.

894
00:55:48,767 --> 00:55:49,567
Whoa.

895
00:55:51,467 --> 00:55:52,433
Such a sweet talker.

896
00:55:56,633 --> 00:55:57,433
So…

897
00:56:00,900 --> 00:56:01,700
What are you doing?

898
00:56:07,067 --> 00:56:08,867
As long as you're here and fill my days,

899
00:56:09,267 --> 00:56:10,367
I'm more than happy.

900
00:56:13,167 --> 00:56:14,181
Hey.

901
00:56:14,721 --> 00:56:15,633
Stop it.

902
00:56:16,567 --> 00:56:17,777
We might fall.

903
00:56:17,777 --> 00:56:18,667
What's wrong with you?

904
00:56:20,367 --> 00:56:21,167
Hey.

905
00:56:28,933 --> 00:56:31,639
You're so active. You go for a run in the morning…

906
00:56:31,639 --> 00:56:33,633
and go for aerobics with me every afternoon.

907
00:56:34,667 --> 00:56:37,133
Because I want to dance with you.

908
00:56:38,467 --> 00:56:40,530
Starting tomorrow,

909
00:56:40,530 --> 00:56:42,100
I'll run with you in the morning.

910
00:56:42,333 --> 00:56:43,133
Seriously?

911
00:56:43,633 --> 00:56:44,433
Um.

912
00:56:44,567 --> 00:56:45,833
Waiting for you…

913
00:56:46,467 --> 00:56:50,112
is lonely. I might as well run with you.

914
00:56:50,112 --> 00:56:51,339
So we can stay together for a long time.

915
00:56:51,732 --> 00:56:54,633
And you won't be looking at anyone else.

916
00:56:55,333 --> 00:56:59,100
How could I look at someone else
when my boyfriend is this pretty?

917
00:57:00,867 --> 00:57:03,500
Go take a shower and change your clothes.

918
00:57:05,967 --> 00:57:07,933
Why? Am I smelly?

919
00:57:08,633 --> 00:57:12,833
No, I just want to be the only one who gets to smell you like this.

920
00:57:14,033 --> 00:57:15,133
Sniff me then.

921
00:57:18,633 --> 00:57:19,579
You should go now.

922
00:57:19,579 --> 00:57:20,767
Alright, I'm leaving.

923
00:57:31,367 --> 00:57:32,733
Late and still playing around?

924
00:57:34,367 --> 00:57:36,571
I'm not playing around, just saying hi to a friend.

925
00:57:36,571 --> 00:57:37,733
Right, Locky?

926
00:57:45,900 --> 00:57:48,300
We'd better go to school or we'll be late.

927
00:57:52,700 --> 00:57:53,567
Give it to me.

928
00:57:56,167 --> 00:57:58,933
Wait, tuck your shirt in.

929
00:57:59,833 --> 00:58:00,633
At the back as well.

930
00:58:04,267 --> 00:58:05,467
You are just like my dad.

931
00:58:06,567 --> 00:58:07,900
Instead of calling you my happiness,

932
00:58:08,167 --> 00:58:09,366
can I call you Daddy?

933
00:58:09,366 --> 00:58:10,067
Hey.

934
00:58:11,100 --> 00:58:11,900
You can't.

935
00:58:12,733 --> 00:58:13,533
Why not?

936
00:58:13,933 --> 00:58:15,033
I said no.

937
00:58:16,100 --> 00:58:17,133
You can't call me like that.

938
00:58:17,433 --> 00:58:18,567
I don't understand.

939
00:58:19,700 --> 00:58:24,969
Alright, you can call me that in another three years.

940
00:58:24,969 --> 00:58:25,700
Okay?

941
00:58:26,367 --> 00:58:28,703
Okay, in another three years…

942
00:58:28,703 --> 00:58:31,033
I'll call you my Daddy.

943
00:58:32,405 --> 00:58:34,205
Fine, let's go.

944
00:58:43,967 --> 00:58:44,767
Tee.

945
00:58:45,900 --> 00:58:47,067
We'll be late.

946
00:58:49,367 --> 00:58:50,167
Hurry up.

947
00:58:51,133 --> 00:58:51,933
What?

948
00:58:52,467 --> 00:58:53,667
It'll be like the last time.

949
00:58:53,833 --> 00:58:54,633
Just a moment.

950
00:58:54,633 --> 00:58:55,933
No, we should leave now.

951
00:59:05,433 --> 00:59:06,233
Why are you surprised?

952
00:59:06,367 --> 00:59:08,133
It's a ghost, not your teacher. Wait.

953
00:59:08,333 --> 00:59:09,633
It's your teacher, not a ghost.

954
00:59:11,067 --> 00:59:12,533
You're overreacting.

955
00:59:13,267 --> 00:59:13,867
Thanyawat.

956
00:59:13,867 --> 00:59:15,833
Teeratat. You guys are late again.

957
00:59:16,233 --> 00:59:18,100
Get in the late line right now. Go.

958
00:59:18,667 --> 00:59:21,133
See, we're late again.

959
00:59:22,367 --> 00:59:23,700
You guys are always late for school.

960
00:59:24,667 --> 00:59:26,267
Thanyawat, start a new line now.

961
00:59:26,433 --> 00:59:27,233
Come here.

962
00:59:27,533 --> 00:59:28,233
He can't.

963
00:59:28,233 --> 00:59:29,133
We came together.

964
00:59:32,267 --> 00:59:34,332
Does it have something to do with starting a new line?

965
00:59:34,332 --> 00:59:36,267
What's the problem?

966
00:59:37,633 --> 00:59:38,667
We're a couple.

967
00:59:42,167 --> 00:59:43,733
Is that true, Thanyawat?

968
00:59:45,567 --> 00:59:46,367
That's true.

969
00:59:50,100 --> 00:59:51,933
Yes, they're together,

970
00:59:52,167 --> 00:59:53,533
I saw it my own eyes.

971
00:59:54,100 --> 00:59:56,133
Oh, so all of you already knew it?

972
00:59:56,867 --> 00:59:57,667
Yes.

973
00:59:58,667 --> 00:59:59,900
Why didn't you tell me?

974
01:00:01,067 --> 01:00:01,867
Ugh.

975
01:00:02,500 --> 01:00:04,733
That's great. As a couple,

976
01:00:04,967 --> 01:00:06,667
you should guide each other in a good direction.

977
01:00:07,700 --> 01:00:10,367
However, you arrive late at school,

978
01:00:11,300 --> 01:00:12,674
you must get punished.

979
01:00:12,674 --> 01:00:14,900
Do 30 squats.

980
01:00:15,467 --> 01:00:17,567
Teacher, I have a boyfriend too.

981
01:00:17,967 --> 01:00:18,933
You too?

982
01:00:19,100 --> 01:00:19,633
Yes.

983
01:00:19,633 --> 01:00:20,433
Who are you dating?

984
01:00:20,500 --> 01:00:21,300
This guy.

985
01:00:21,633 --> 01:00:22,433
Rodtang?

986
01:00:23,100 --> 01:00:23,900
This guy.

987
01:00:24,467 --> 01:00:25,267
Book?

988
01:00:25,433 --> 01:00:26,700
Are you really dating him?

989
01:00:27,233 --> 01:00:28,033
Yes.

990
01:00:28,167 --> 01:00:29,167
Teacher.

991
01:00:29,767 --> 01:00:31,233
I have my happiness as well.

992
01:00:31,867 --> 01:00:32,667
Where is your happiness?

993
01:00:32,867 --> 01:00:33,667
This man.

994
01:00:35,333 --> 01:00:37,033
Um, you two look good together.

995
01:00:37,667 --> 01:00:38,467
Teacher.

996
01:00:38,500 --> 01:00:40,133
Yes?
I also have a boyfriend.

997
01:00:40,767 --> 01:00:41,867
Where is he?

998
01:00:42,333 --> 01:00:43,667
He's at another school.

999
01:00:44,267 --> 01:00:47,467
Oh my, why the students from this school so charming?

1000
01:00:48,033 --> 01:00:48,833
Teacher.

1001
01:00:49,300 --> 01:00:50,167
Do you have a boyfriend too?

1002
01:00:50,500 --> 01:00:51,880
I'm completely unwanted.

1003
01:00:51,880 --> 01:00:52,633
Ugh.

1004
01:00:53,733 --> 01:00:54,533
Alright.

1005
01:00:54,833 --> 01:00:59,704
So, you guys have to do 30 squats. All of you.

1006
01:00:59,704 --> 01:01:00,553
Get ready for it.

1007
01:01:00,553 --> 01:01:02,733
Come on, get yourself ready.

1008
01:01:04,300 --> 01:01:05,100
Teacher.

1009
01:01:05,967 --> 01:01:06,633
Hmm?

1010
01:01:06,633 --> 01:01:07,533
Yes, Teacher Lookmee.

1011
01:01:07,700 --> 01:01:08,967
Here is the document for you to sign.

1012
01:01:09,100 --> 01:01:09,900
Oh, okay.

1013
01:01:10,100 --> 01:01:11,367
Does it need to be signed today?

1014
01:01:11,733 --> 01:01:12,829
Yes, exactly.

1015
01:01:12,829 --> 01:01:13,329
Alright.

1016
01:01:13,500 --> 01:01:14,300
Yes.

1017
01:01:14,567 --> 01:01:16,067
Another page too.

1018
01:01:21,067 --> 01:01:24,572
Hey, these kids.

1019
01:01:25,652 --> 01:01:29,467
You're totally interrupting me.
They're students who are late for school.

1020
01:01:29,467 --> 01:01:30,267
Thank you.

1021
01:01:32,900 --> 01:01:33,700
Hello.

1022
01:01:33,701 --> 01:01:34,267
Hello.

1023
01:01:34,267 --> 01:01:35,067
Hello.

1024
01:01:36,500 --> 01:01:37,767
I'm Rodtang.

1025
01:01:38,467 --> 01:01:40,900
I wonder, in the next ten years,

1026
01:01:41,293 --> 01:01:43,467
what you all will be doing?

1027
01:01:44,167 --> 01:01:46,467
In the next ten years? I think I would run a business.

1028
01:01:47,067 --> 01:01:48,258
I want to open a pet grooming salon.

1029
01:01:48,258 --> 01:01:50,100
Wow.

1030
01:01:50,300 --> 01:01:50,807
That's so sick.

1031
01:01:50,807 --> 01:01:51,533
And…

1032
01:01:52,767 --> 01:01:53,567
I probably take care of a kid.

1033
01:01:54,167 --> 01:01:54,667
A kid? Who?

1034
01:01:54,667 --> 01:01:55,167
Hey.

1035
01:01:56,067 --> 01:01:56,867
Just someone around here.

1036
01:02:01,233 --> 01:02:02,033
For me,

1037
01:02:02,333 --> 01:02:03,900
I'll take over the shop from my dad.

1038
01:02:04,133 --> 01:02:05,700
I'll expand my shop to ten branches.

1039
01:02:06,300 --> 01:02:07,100
Wow.

1040
01:02:07,867 --> 01:02:09,333
Rodtang and I will visit your shop.

1041
01:02:09,433 --> 01:02:10,733
That's cool, man.

1042
01:02:12,700 --> 01:02:17,067
I want to have children in the next ten years.

1043
01:02:17,300 --> 01:02:19,346
Hey.

1044
01:02:19,346 --> 01:02:20,524
Having children?

1045
01:02:20,917 --> 01:02:22,377
Isn't it a bit too soon?

1046
01:02:22,377 --> 01:02:26,407
I want to be a TikTok influencer.

1047
01:02:27,389 --> 01:02:28,767
Reviewing some products.

1048
01:02:29,433 --> 01:02:31,130
Do you think I could be an influencer?

1049
01:02:31,131 --> 01:02:31,707
Absolutely.

1050
01:02:31,707 --> 01:02:33,020
Of course.

1051
01:02:35,414 --> 01:02:36,628
For me,

1052
01:02:36,629 --> 01:02:38,629
I want to debut as a T-Pop artist.

1053
01:02:38,629 --> 01:02:39,254
Really?

1054
01:02:39,254 --> 01:02:39,767
Um.

1055
01:02:39,767 --> 01:02:41,767
Can I be your very first fan?

1056
01:02:44,274 --> 01:02:46,133
When my song goes viral…

1057
01:02:46,133 --> 01:02:47,633
and people use it for aerobics,

1058
01:02:47,767 --> 01:02:48,784
let's dance together.

1059
01:02:48,784 --> 01:02:49,367
Sure.

1060
01:02:49,768 --> 01:02:51,425
Whoa.

1061
01:02:51,425 --> 01:02:52,665
So sweet.

1062
01:02:53,500 --> 01:02:56,100
I might take a scholarship exam to study abroad.

1063
01:02:56,367 --> 01:02:57,667
Hey, what about me?

1064
01:02:58,300 --> 01:02:59,100
Can I go with you?

1065
01:03:01,567 --> 01:03:02,500
You can't.

1066
01:03:03,533 --> 01:03:04,408
You're dumb.

1067
01:03:08,287 --> 01:03:09,900
I'm going to study hard right now.

1068
01:03:10,867 --> 01:03:11,667
I hope you mean it.

1069
01:03:12,100 --> 01:03:12,933
For me,

1070
01:03:14,567 --> 01:03:16,233
I want to be a reporter.

1071
01:03:16,233 --> 01:03:16,733
Why?

1072
01:03:16,733 --> 01:03:18,300
Because I'm nosy.

1073
01:03:20,042 --> 01:03:22,042
Being nosy.

1074
01:03:23,100 --> 01:03:24,467
That's suit you.

1075
01:03:26,833 --> 01:03:27,967
Ten years from now on?

1076
01:03:29,333 --> 01:03:31,200
By then, I probably have graduated.

1077
01:03:31,495 --> 01:03:34,669
Started working and moved in with my boyfriend.

1078
01:03:37,900 --> 01:03:40,967
We'll see each other in the evenings
and go out together on weekends.

1079
01:03:45,767 --> 01:03:48,461
By that time, I'll probably keep walking.

1080
01:03:48,903 --> 01:03:50,742
Where to?

1081
01:03:52,133 --> 01:03:53,093
Just keep walking forward,

1082
01:03:53,584 --> 01:03:56,739
towards my future and my love.

1083
01:04:00,814 --> 01:04:02,134
I guess I'll just keep walking…

1084
01:04:02,134 --> 01:04:04,847
alongside this four-eyes next to me.

1085
01:04:05,633 --> 01:04:08,575
Gosh, that's so cute.

1086
01:04:09,090 --> 01:04:11,728
Can you stop recording? I'm gonna kiss my boyfriend.

1087
01:04:13,167 --> 01:04:14,433
Okay, sure.

1088
01:04:15,500 --> 01:04:18,100
See you again in ten years.

1089
01:04:18,433 --> 01:04:19,300
See you.

1090
01:04:19,633 --> 01:04:21,809
Bye bye.

1091
01:04:24,067 --> 01:04:24,567
Hey.

1092
01:04:24,567 --> 01:04:25,933
Go, let's go.
